000542r 2                       beq p0
000542r 2                       tax
000542r 2                       jmpx et
000542r 2               np:     jmp partial
000542r 2               et:     .word p0, p1, p2, p3
000542r 2               p0:     MPAIR 0, mirror
000542r 2               p1:     MPAIR 2, mirror
000542r 2               p2:     MPAIR 4, mirror
000542r 2               p3:     MPAIR 6, mirror
